{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/5925","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:57:13.020706+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Describe the bug\n\nUsing `tt.fp_to_fp` with `rtne` semantics on A100 to convert `f16` to `f8e5m2` yields wrong results.\n\nFor instance, `9` rounds to `10` instead of the expected `8` Doing the job of rounding manually using additional guard-round-sticky bits for convenience, we have the following representations for 8, 9 and 10 in `f8e5m2`:\n\n```\n01001000|000 // 8\n01001000|100 // 9\n01001001|000 // 10\n```\n\nAccording to round-to-nearest-even semantics, when only the guard bit is set, we should round to make the last bit of the mantissa even. In this case, this means rounding down. The bit-twiddling algorithm used for conversion on A100 therefore seems wrong.\n\n### Environment details\n\nGPU: A100","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/5925/comments","created_at":"2025-02-14T10:43:33Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/5925/events","html_url":"https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/issues/5925","id":2853324362,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null,"id":125679820,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU2Nzk4MjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/5925/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOAWaHXs6qEkZK","number":5925,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.gi